pes, none lost. No repeats are stated."}, {"term": "Pass", "text": "The input does not say what makes a task pass. Kept failures are scored against an expected plan of tool calls and their arguments."}, {"term": "Intervals", "text": "{compare.brisk-s.low.r1.nano-xs.high.r1.pass_rate.overall.level}, computed from each option's pass rate and case count, combined as if the options ran different cases, so they read wider than paired ones. No correction for the many comparisons. Task figures state no counts and carry no interval."}, {"term": "Cost", "text": "Cost per 1k calls, a point figure with no spread. Monthly figures use the declared volume of {meta.volume_per_month} a month; the input does not say what that volume counts."}, {"term": "Latency", "text": "p50 and p95 per option; no latency budget was declared."}, {"term": "Not compared", "text": "There is no control and nothing was declared in advance: no gate, floor, margin or exchange rate."}, {"term": "Source", "text": "{meta.provenance}, run {meta.run_date}."}]}
